5, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Onde posso consultar o regulamento oficial e percursos?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O regulamento oficial detalhado e informa\u00e7\u00f5es de percurso podem ser consultados atrav\u00e9s da liga\u00e7\u00e3o oficial de regulamento indicada nesta p\u00e1gina.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<\/div>\n<p><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"Trail Mort\u00e1gua 2026\", \"startDate\": \"2026-11-01\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\", \"name\": \"Mort\u00e1gua, Viseu\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"Mort\u00e1gua, Viseu\", \"addressRegion\": \"Mort\u00e1gua, Viseu\", \"addressCountry\": \"PT\"}}}<\/script><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quando e onde se realiza o Trail Mort\u00e1gua 2026?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O evento realiza-se no dia 1 de Novembro de 2026 (Domingo) com partida marcada para as 09:00, em Mort\u00e1gua, Viseu, no concelho de Mort\u00e1gua, Viseu.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quais s\u00e3o as dist\u00e2ncias dispon\u00edveis no Trail Mort\u00e1gua 2026?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O programa inclui os percursos oficiais de 22 km, 14 km, 13 km, 12 km, 10 km e 8 km.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Como e onde posso efetuar a inscri\u00e7\u00e3o oficial?\", \"acceptedAnswer